## Host map (frozen — P6 canonical)

| Surface      | Dev canonical host | Prod platform | App              |
| ------------ | ------------------ | ------------- | ---------------- |
| Marketing    | `{club}.localhost:3002` | `{club}.{root}` | `apps/marketing` |
| Portal       | `{club}.portal.localhost:3003` | `{club}.portal.{root}` | `apps/portal`    |
| Web redirect | `{club}.admin.localhost:3000` public path | redirect only | `apps/web`       |

**Legacy dev smoke:** `shop.{club}.localhost:3002` · `{club}.localhost:3003` · `{club}.localhost:3000` — still resolve same tenant. See [p6-host-addressing-architecture.mdoc](../phase-19/p6-host-addressing-architecture.mdoc).

---

## URL resolution

```typescript
// apps/marketing/src/portal/resolve-web-registration-url.ts
// → buildDevPortalPublicBaseUrl (@app-tour/tenant-kernel)
// Priority: PORTAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL → dev canonical {club}.portal.localhost:PORTAL_DEV_PORT
```

| Env                         | App            | Purpose                 | Prod required |
| --------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------------- | ------------- |
| `PORTAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`    | marketing, web | Prod portal origin      | Yes (prod)    |
| `PORTAL_DEV_PORT`           | marketing      | Default `3003` local    | Dev only      |
| `MARKETING_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` | web            | Catalog redirect source | Yes (prod)    |

Marketing detail CTA:

```html
<a href="{registrationUrl}" data-marketing-register></a>
```

`registrationUrl` = `{portalBase}/catalog/{tourId}/register`

